C31 patch A -- open the settings dialog from a menu (5 lines in GalleryWindow.hpp, 2 in Main.cpp).
Generated with git diff against main@35bb3be and verified with "git apply --check".
Apply:  git apply tools/patches/c31-settings-from-menu.patch
GalleryWindow.hpp and Main.cpp belong to C27/C29 and C25, so this is a patch, not an edit:
whoever lands first takes it verbatim. The dialog owns Store/SettingsFile, so no other file
has to learn where settings live.
